<title>GERMANY: Walter Bau says five-month orders &quot;good&quot;.</title>
<headline>Walter Bau says five-month orders &quot;good&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>AUGSBURG, Germany 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction group Walter Bau AG chief financial officer Peter Kern said on Friday that five-month new orders were good and would favourably affect profit.</p>
<p>Kern made the comment at the start of Walter Bau's annual general meeting.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
